      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WE CAN (3) comes off an average run last start when fourth at this track over 350m behind Lumbar (20.15). Rates on top in this line up. UNCERTAIN (1) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten one length, (17.25) at this track. The form from her last run stacks up well. Winning chance. TAKE A RHINO (7) shows ability but remains a maiden after 17 starts. Missed the frame when fourth (20.82) at Traralgon latest but was in the placings the start before. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected.",
